Comment: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:21.78,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:28.79,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:55.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base and M'Quve's fleet\Nare now at a standstill...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...as they hide in the floating debris\Nof the Texas zone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:02:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... unable to confirm\Neach others precise location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it? Who's watching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:41.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't mention it{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:43.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're no ordinary soldier, Lalah{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luck's on our side.\NThe air is escaping more slowly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry and get back to the Zanzibar!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:55.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll stay behind and stall the Gundam{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. But, Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lalah!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you\Nthere's no need to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now hurry and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char, the Red Comet... I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm concerned about Amuro too, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:30.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... in this situation, the one who moves first\Nis at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro will be fine.\NHe's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... I just know, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Dellamin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:57.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have a clear advantage\Nin fighting strength. Let's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:04:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. We're only up against one enemy,\Nbut it is a large warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:02.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we carelessly revealed ourselves now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.89,0:04:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the Baromel has been attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Uragang!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:12.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you learn anything\Nwhile serving under Captain M'Quve?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:15.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Barom's ship\Nwill be here very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll wait until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange. The other mobile suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was careless of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a red mobile suit,\Nso the pilot could've been Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A car?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That car...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found you, Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:05:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Lalah! I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was Char attacking me from the rear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or was that a different enemy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might be getting complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:22.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam's pilot\Nmay be a Newtype as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll check one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems there's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My firing was accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he dodged every shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming from the side?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time from the front!\NYou're good, Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Char?\NWhere's he coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right...just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char. I can read your moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.86,0:06:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon, you've gotta respond a little faster...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should've broken this thing in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.76,0:07:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've used up a lot of energy... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I almost had him, too...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did that get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But would Char really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's badly damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt that pilot\Nfell for a dummy explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:23.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't we able to get in touch\Nwith the White Base yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.07,0:08:28.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir. The area has a high Minovsky particle\Ndensity, and with all the floating debris...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know all that.\NBut we still must...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait. Just a moment, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it the White Base?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a Zeon high-speed heavy cruiser!\NDirection 08-32. Relative velocity, 0078.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. Point us toward the enemy ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare to open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a vessel approaching us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Federation Magellan-class battleship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Prepare for battle!\NRotate main cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lights from possible combat\Ndetected at points A-17, B-33.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're on Captain Barom's flight course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.66,0:09:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain. Could it be Barom...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:18.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All vessels! Abandon your present positions!\NProceed to specified coordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've detected the enemy fleet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heading for the unconfirmed battle zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they got impatient...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla! Launch the G-Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Job John, stand by in the Guncannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White Base, proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're entering fleet combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.23,0:09:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Fighter, launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse is coming from behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:01.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one panic! Fire all guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:05.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:13.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are they attacking with only one fighter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mega particle cannons!\NMain cannons! Missiles! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Large number of missiles incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the anti-missiles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:45.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almost too easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:54.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, it's frightening to see what happens\Nwhen the momentum has shifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-They got us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:08.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good. Turnabout 180 degrees.\NWe'll approach the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One vessel advancing from\Nthe unconfirmed battle zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, just a moment! We have it!\NIt looks like a Magellan-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magellan...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lieutenant Bright{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There might be enemy survivors inside{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:32.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Be cautious. I'll wait outside{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:45.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gotten a lot tougher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marker. Where did you detect the explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, sir! Around Point N-5 in the C-Block.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Proceeding to N-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.81,0:11:59.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Omur! Sayla! Job! Stand by on the buggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commencing descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Touchdown completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:40.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Omur! Sayla! Job!\NGo out and search.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to level 2 battle stations\Nuntil we find Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have Kai standby in the Guncannon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw. What's the status of the radio comm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw! What's the status of the radio comm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yes, it should be okay to use!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:12.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Job John here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Job John here! Come in, White Base!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes! White Base here, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't located the Gundam yet{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:25.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:31.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw, could you go see how Hayato's doing?\NHe must be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw. Have Vammas come up here quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.\NI understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla here. Sayla here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.77,0:13:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sayla?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's not Fraw Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:01.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just relieved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well? Have you found anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:05.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. I'll keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to quit the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now you've become a Petty Officer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Joining the Zeon military\Nto take revenge on the Zabi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your actions don't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:30.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you truly believe that your own brother\Nis such a petty man, Artesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who...Who is she talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That voice...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The things Jimba Ral told us\Nmight have been true after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:47.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The old man always used to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did your father, Lord Zeon,{\i}\N{\i1}create the Republic of Zeon?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:15:00.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He did it for the the future of all mankind{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...{\i1}who are destined{\i}\N{\i1}to be reborn as Newtypes{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.05,0:15:06.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But he suddenly fell ill{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...{\i1}and on his deathbed{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...{\i1}your father singled out Degwin Zabi{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wish someone like me\Nto be the next prime minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:23.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I understood Lord Zeon's{\i}\N{\i1}temperament very well{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He pointed out Degwin{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:30.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... {\i1}to let us know that it was Degwin{\i}\N{\i1}who'd assassinated him{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:34.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why else would your father's allies{\i}\N{\i1}have died, one after another?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that's why I had no choice but{\i}\N{\i1}to raise you two, Casval and Artesia{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...{\i1}on Earth under false identities{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason why I entered Zeon, and went\Nfrom high school to military academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...was so I could get close to the Zabi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Artesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:16:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've grown up a little since that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I realized that even if\Nthe Federation defeats the Zabi family...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... humanity won't achieve true peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Newtypes have appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean because Amuro's a Newtype?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:15.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Newtype?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not pleased that a Newtype\Nhas become my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll have to fight any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jimba Ral taught us that Newtypes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...are the ideal towards which\Nthe entire human race should strive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In which case, there should be no need\Nto make Newtypes your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Casval!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, what are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'll fight any way I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Artesia, you must leave the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trojan Horse?! You mean the White Base?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll leave you enough gold\Nto pay your way from here to Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to Earth and live out your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer the brother you once knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must know why I wear this mask...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:06.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because I've discarded my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:11.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Artesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see your face one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:19.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider... my dear brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:22.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful, Artesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:27.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,War doesn't suit you.\NLeave the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Casval, my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Casval, my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright! What's the matter, Bright?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:41.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Amuro...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The static was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. But I am worried about Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Casval, my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:01.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Br... Brother...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:11.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No good. They've all been burned out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?\NI've never seen a machine like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a White Base buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:28.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!\NMs. Sayla has found Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't move, so we'll need the Gunperry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:37.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Send it out immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:39.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmission from Wakkein.\NA Zanzibar-class warship is leaving...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...from the port on the other side of Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cancel the Gunperry launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll go in the White Base and pick up\Nthe Gundam, Omur and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just one Magellan-class ship!\NWe'll break through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:04.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain. What exactly happened\Nwhile you were in Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah... Even my life has\Nits share of tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.05,0:19:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we've been able\Nto retrieve my Gelgoog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:28.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just one enemy ship! Aim carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:30.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base will be here soon to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:32.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must hold our ground until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:44.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mirai, take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Depart from the same port as the Zanzibar\Nand begin pursuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've detected a signal-emitting\Nobject near Shutter No. 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it an explosive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. But it's very small.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?! At a desperate time like this...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:17.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have Omur check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.11,0:20:24.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright! Doesn't look like it's an explosive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commandant Wakkein!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That bastard Char...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We were too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:14.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commandant Wakkein...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I know is that the letter attached\Nto the case is addressed to you, Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.55,0:21:36.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ditto for Omur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any idea who it's from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.11,0:21:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have the right to inspect this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.03,0:21:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather you told me the contents\Nof the case, and who sent it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe that the case is filled with gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're quite sure of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almost positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.34,0:21:59.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And who sent it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char Aznable, the Red Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.25,0:22:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hope with all my heart\Nthat you'll fulfill your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the gentle Artesia Som Deikun...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:23.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...With love, from Casval Rem Deikun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dear brother Casval...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.33,0:22:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dear brother Casval...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sayla...or rather, Artesia...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:51.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...felt that as long as she could remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.29,0:22:55.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...she had followed her brother's back\Nalways calling out his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.63,0:22:58.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When he was there beside her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And when he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:03.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would she never again be able to call him...\Nher brother Casval?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.41,0:23:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before anyone knows it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the war enters a new stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:28.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The phantom attacks\Nof one single mobile armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:30.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...confuse Amuro,\Ncausing the Gundam's functions to falter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.53,0:23:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NThe Newtype: Challia Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:40.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
